{"speciesId":8,"names":{"fr":"Carabaffe","es":"Wartortle","en":"Wartortle","ja":"カメール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Often hides in water to stalk unwary prey. For swimming fast, it moves its ears to maintain balance."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Often hides in water to stalk unwary prey. For swimming fast, it moves its ears to maintain balance."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"When tapped, this POKéMON will pull in its head, but its tail will still stick out a little bit."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is recognized as a symbol of longevity. If its shell has algae on it, that WARTORTLE is very old."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It cleverly con­ trols its furry ears and tail to maintain its balance while swimming."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Its long, furry tail is a symbol of longevity, making it quite popular among older people."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as WARTORTLE ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this POKéMON’s toughness as a battler."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as WARTORTLE ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this POKéMON’s toughness as a battler."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its large tail is covered with rich, thick fur that deepens in color with age. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this POKéMON’s toughness in battle."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This POKéMON is very popular as a pet. Its fur-covered tail is a symbol of its longevity."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It often hides in water to stalk unwary prey. For fast swimming, it moves its ears to maintain balance."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is a well-established symbol of longevity. If its shell has algae on it, that WARTORTLE is very old."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It cleverly controls its furry ears and tail to maintain its balance while swimming."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On prétend qu’il vit 10 000 ans. Sa queue duveteuse est un symbole de longévité populaire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On prétend qu’il vit 10 000 ans. Sa queue duveteuse est un symbole de longévité populaire."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Attaqué, il cache sa tête dans sa carapace, mais son corps trop gros ne peut y tenir en entier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si es golpeado, esconderá su cabeza. Aun así, su cola puede seguir golpeando."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When tapped, this Pokémon will pull in its head, but its tail will still stick out a little bit."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ポカンと 頭を たたかれるとき 甲羅に 引っこんで 避ける。でも ちょっとだけ 尻尾が 出ているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On prétend qu’il vit 10 000 ans. Sa queue duveteuse est un symbole de longévité populaire."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se dice que vive 10 000 años. Su peluda cola es un símbolo de longevidad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１万年の 寿命を 持つと 言われている。ふさふさの 尻尾は 長生きの シンボルとして 人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Carabaffe a une large queue recouverte d’une épaisse fourrure. Elle devient de plus en plus foncée avec l’âge. Les éraflures sur la carapace de ce Pokémon témoignent de son expérience au combat."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tiene una cola larga y cubierta de un pelo abundante y grueso que se torna más oscuro a medida que crece. Los arañazos que tiene en el caparazón dan fe de lo buen guerrero que es."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as Wartortle ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this Pokémon’s toughness as a battler."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ふさふさの 毛で 覆われた 大きな 尻尾は 長生き するほど 深い 色合いに 変わる。 甲羅の キズは 強者の 証。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Carabaffe a une large queue recouverte d’une épaisse fourrure. Elle devient de plus en plus foncée avec l’âge. Les éraflures sur la carapace de ce Pokémon témoignent de son expérience au combat."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tiene una cola larga y cubierta de un pelo abundante y grueso que se torna más oscuro a medida que crece. Los arañazos que tiene en el caparazón dan fe de lo buen guerrero que es."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as Wartortle ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this Pokémon’s toughness as a battler."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ふさふさの 毛で 覆われた 大きな 尻尾は 長生き するほど 深い 色合いに 変わる。 甲羅の キズは 強者の 証。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Quand on lui tapote la tête, il se cache dans sa carapace, mais son corps ne peut pas y tenir en entier."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Si alguien le golpea la cabeza, se protege escondiéndose en su caparazón, aunque parte de la cola queda al descubierto."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"When tapped on its head, this Pokémon will pull it in, but its tail will still stick out a little bit."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ポカンと 頭を たたかれるとき こうらに 引っこんで よける。でも ちょっとだけ シッポが 出ているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Quand on lui tapote la tête, il se cache dans sa carapace, mais son corps ne peut pas y tenir en entier."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Si alguien le golpea la cabeza, se protege escondiéndose en su caparazón, aunque parte de la cola queda al descubierto."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"When tapped on its head, this Pokémon will pull it in, but its tail will still stick out a little bit."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ポカンと 頭を たたかれるとき こうらに 引っこんで よける。でも ちょっとだけ シッポが 出ているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est considéré comme un symbole de longévité. On reconnaît les spécimens les plus âgés à la mousse qui pousse sur leur carapace."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se lo considera un símbolo de longevidad. Los ejemplares más ancianos tienen musgo sobre el caparazón."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It is recognized as a symbol of longevity. If its shell has algae on it, that Wartortle is very old."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"長生きの シンボルと されている。 甲羅に 苔が ついているのは とくに 長生きの カメールだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se sert habilement de sa queue et de ses oreilles touffues pour garder son équilibre sous l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":